# ScenarioForge MetaDrive-only One-Run P0 PRD

## Source Requirement
Define a realistic, executable one-run MVP for Zaofu ScenarioForge. P0 must use MetaDrive as its only execution backend and include a versioned ScenarioSpec; JSON/YAML import, export, and schema validation; a Web scenario editor; MetaDrive compilation and lifecycle controls; Three.js replay; metrics; bounded local batch execution; deterministic seed replay; traceability to scenario, code, upstream version, and seed; focused tests; a production build; CI; licenses; and a non-production safety disclaimer. SMARTS integration, cross-backend comparison, natural-language scenario generation, and failure-case minimization are explicit P1/P2 non-goals and must not enter P0. Evaluate the scope through product, simulation architecture, frontend/interaction, verification/safety, and open-source compliance perspectives. Resolve adapter boundaries, reproducibility guarantees, resource limits, acceptance evidence, executable-demo criteria, and explicit non-goals into a coherent PRD suitable for one end-to-end run.

## Requirement
交付一个本地单用户、MetaDrive-only 的端到端 ScenarioForge P0：用户可在 Web 中导入、编辑、校验和导出版本化 ScenarioSpec，经 MetaDrive compiler 与受限 runner 执行一个有界 seed batch，获得指标、不可变 Run Bundle、Three.js 精确记录回放及容差型重新仿真报告。P0 以源码、锁文件和本地安装文档交付；依赖锁定、容差校准、许可证矩阵和真实 MetaDrive 容量 benchmark 是发布门禁。

