- {"decision":"P0 唯一执行后端为 MetaDrive，不实现或预埋通用多后端执行路径。","id":"D-01","resolution":"owner_decision","source_ref":"event:evt-e6be102d30a9"}
- {"decision":"ScenarioSpec 保持 seed-independent；RunRequest 持有有序 seed 列表，CompiledBundle 固化逐 case seed、有效 MetaDrive config 和 provenance。","id":"D-02","resolution":"owner_decision","source_ref":"event:evt-e6be102d30a9"}
- {"decision":"资源采用安全默认上限/硬 schema 最大值：cases 4/16、actors 4/8、workers 1/2、aggregate CPU threads 2/4、steps 3000/10000、simulated seconds 30/60、wall seconds per case 60/120、bundle wall minutes 10/30、bundle disk GiB 1/2。","id":"D-03","resolution":"owner_decision","source_ref":"event:evt-e6be102d30a9"}
