## Assumptions
- ScenarioSpec、CompiledBundle、RunRecord、RunBundle 和 trace 各自具有独立版本；JSON/YAML 经严格 schema 校验后转换为 RFC 8785 canonical JSON，并以 SHA-256 建立身份链。
- RunRequest seed 列表有序且不重复；Web 默认提交一个 seed，默认 profile 最多接受 4 cases，硬 schema 最大值为 16。
- actors 数量包含恰好一个 ego；默认 profile 最多 4 个 actors，硬 schema 最大值为 8。
- 执行期间只有 staging workspace 和 JobStatus 可变；成功、失败、超时、取消或全局故障均须封存可审计 Run Bundle，封存后不得覆盖、追加或恢复。
- 场景碰撞或 assertion failure 是有效仿真结果；单 case runtime failure 生成终态记录后可在干净 worker 中继续，取消、bundle 配额或 supervisor 故障停止剩余 cases。
- 所有 ScenarioSpec、上传文件、归档、Run Bundle、trace 和 metadata 都是不可信输入；Web 仅监听 loopback，runner 采用最小环境、禁止外网和任意代码执行。
- 参考验收环境为锁定的 Linux CPU/headless MetaDrive 和受支持 Chromium；不承诺跨平台、GPU、视频字节或 WebGL 像素一致。
- 核心指标至少包括 execution status、scenario verdict、termination reason、steps、simulated seconds、collision/off-road 状态、route progress 和资源使用。
- 数值 tolerance profile 只能由重复真实 MetaDrive 运行校准；未有证据前不得宣称既定公差已被验证。

## Out of Scope
- SMARTS 集成
- 跨后端映射、执行或结果比较
- 自然语言场景生成
- 失败用例最小化、搜索或优化
- 云端、分布式或多用户执行
- 任意 Python、插件或用户策略执行
- 自由道路/CAD 级地图创作和未核验外部数据集
- 真实车辆、HIL、公共道路决策或安全认证
- 跨操作系统、CPU/GPU 的 bitwise trajectory、video 或 pixel 一致性

## Acceptance Criteria
- {"criterion":"When 语义等价的 JSON 和 YAML ScenarioSpec 被导入，the system shall 生成相同 canonical bytes 和 scenario_digest，并在导出后重新导入时保持语义等价。","evidence":"schema fixtures、round-trip report、canonical digest report","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-01","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When 输入含未知版本或字段、非有限数值、危险 YAML、代码、URL、路径、环境引用、越界 seed、actor 或资源值，the system shall 在执行前拒绝并返回字段级诊断。","evidence":"negative schema and injection fixture matrix","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-02","reviewer":"security_reviewer"}
- {"criterion":"When 同一 ScenarioSpec 和 RunRequest 被重复编译，the compiler shall 为每个字段产生明确 MetaDrive 映射或错误，并生成相同 CompiledBundle/config digests。","evidence":"field-mapping coverage、golden compiled configs、digest repeat test","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-03","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When 一个有效 RunRequest 被接受，the runner shall 仅调用锁定的 MetaDrive backend，并为每个 seed 产生 RunRecord、trace、指标和终态。","evidence":"real-provider headless smoke Run Bundle、backend call trace、version provenance","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-04","reviewer":"product_pm"}
- {"criterion":"When 请求处于默认档或硬最大值边界，the runner shall 遵守 cases、actors、workers、CPU threads、steps、simulated time、wall time、bundle time 和 disk 限制；超过最大值的请求必须预检拒绝。","evidence":"boundary suite、capacity benchmark、limit-hit RunRecords","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-05","reviewer":"security_reviewer"}
- {"criterion":"When case crash、timeout、cancel、disk exhaustion 或 supervisor failure 被注入，the system shall 保留已完成结果、记录当前和剩余 case 的明确终态、终止进程树并封存 partial/cancelled/aborted Bundle，且不得静默重试。","evidence":"fault-injection bundles and lifecycle report","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-06","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When Three.js 加载有效封存 Bundle，the replay shall 在 runner 停止且断网时支持 case 选择、播放、暂停、逐 step、seek、倍速、事件和指标联动，并在 canonical tick 显示记录原值而不调用 MetaDrive。","evidence":"Chromium replay E2E、checkpoint value assertions、zero MetaDrive/network call log","evidence_owner":"product_pm","id":"AC-07","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When Bundle、manifest、trace 或 artifact digest 被篡改，the replay and verifier shall 在解析或渲染前 fail closed，并报告具体完整性错误。","evidence":"tamper matrix and immutable bundle tests","evidence_owner":"security_reviewer","id":"AC-08","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When 同一 scenario 和 seed 在兼容锁定环境重新仿真，the verifier shall 创建新 Bundle，并以 exact 离散字段和校准后的 tolerance profile 返回 pass 或 regression；兼容键不匹配时只能返回 incompatible。","evidence":"dependency pins、five-run calibration、oracle diff、baseline compatibility tests","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-09","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When 用户在受支持 Chromium 走完整黄金路径，the Web application shall 完成导入、编辑、字段错误定位、canonical preview、真实 MetaDrive run、指标、Three.js replay 和 JSON/YAML 导出，关键路径不得使用 mock provider。","evidence":"production-build Chromium E2E and demo transcript","evidence_owner":"product_pm","id":"AC-10","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When 依赖和允许资产按文档安装后外网被关闭，the application shall 仅通过 loopback 完成运行和回放；缺失资产时必须 fail closed，不得自动联网。","evidence":"clean-install report、offline network capture、asset manifest","evidence_owner":"security_reviewer","id":"AC-11","reviewer":"arch"}
- {"criterion":"When Web/API 接收到非法 Origin、CSRF、能力令牌、路径穿越、symlink/hardlink、archive bomb、XSS、pickle 或 secret canary，the system shall 拒绝请求且不得把 secret、header、cookie 或宿主绝对路径写入日志和 Bundle。","evidence":"security negative suite、secret scan、process/network isolation report","evidence_owner":"security_reviewer","id":"AC-12","reviewer":"critic"}
- {"criterion":"When release candidate 被组装，the delivery shall 包含源码、依赖锁、local-install 文档、production build、CI results、SBOM、LICENSE/NOTICE、license matrix、资产来源、capacity benchmark、tolerance report、威胁模型、演示 Bundle 和非生产安全免责声明。","evidence":"release evidence index","evidence_owner":"security_reviewer","id":"AC-13","reviewer":"product_pm"}
- {"criterion":"When CI 和 release gates 执行，the project shall 通过 focused schema/compiler/runtime tests、ruff check、pytest、Web production build、Chromium E2E、真实 MetaDrive smoke、容量/确定性 benchmark、许可证和 secret checks。","evidence":"CI run manifest and release-gate report","evidence_owner":"arch","id":"AC-14","reviewer":"critic"}

## Risks
- {"mitigation":"发布前执行容量 benchmark；默认值可凭证据收紧，提高默认档需证据，放宽 schema 最大值需受控合同修订。","risk":"Owner 冻结的资源默认值或最大值可能无法在真实 MetaDrive 参考环境稳定满足。","severity":"high"}
- {"mitigation":"精确依赖锁、platform fingerprint、版本化 tolerance profile 和 incompatible 结果语义。","risk":"MetaDrive、Python、物理或数值依赖变化造成轨迹漂移。","severity":"high"}
- {"mitigation":"严格 schema、安全解析、loopback/CSRF、无 pickle/eval、路径隔离、进程与网络限制及负面测试。","risk":"不可信 ScenarioSpec、归档或 replay 数据导致路径逃逸、代码执行、资源耗尽或 XSS。","severity":"high"}
- {"mitigation":"完整摘要链、不可变 Bundle、exact replay 与 re-simulation API/UX 分离。","risk":"封存证据被修改或 replay 被误当作重新仿真的证明。","severity":"high"}
- {"mitigation":"P0 源码交付、SBOM、license matrix、NOTICE、资产来源和 fail-closed packaging gate。","risk":"MetaDrive 顶层许可证被误认为覆盖所有传递依赖和资产。","severity":"high"}
- {"mitigation":"按 target_member_id 与 request_id 折叠，仅消费最新 completed body；旧摘要只作 incident provenance。","risk":"repaired-routing 重复终态可能膨胀参与轮次或投票权重。","severity":"medium"}

## Dissent
- {"content":"早期资源上限与并发提案互相冲突，且缺少真实 MetaDrive benchmark，不能把任一候选值描述为已验证容量。","evidence_that_can_change_conclusion":"绑定参考硬件、依赖锁和完整资源观测的真实 MetaDrive benchmark；放宽 schema 最大值还需要受控合同修订。","resolution":"Owner 已冻结新的默认/最大值对；综合稿将其视为产品边界，同时保留 capacity benchmark 为发布门禁。","roles":["arch","critic","product_pm","security_reviewer"]}
- {"content":"反对将本地来源或 Run Bundle 视为受信输入。","evidence_that_can_change_conclusion":"无；这是 P0 安全不变量。","resolution":"采纳；所有输入、归档和 replay 产物均按不可信数据处理。","role":"security_reviewer"}
- {"content":"Round 1 曾建议更大的 batch 和并发。","evidence_that_can_change_conclusion":"未来真实 MetaDrive benchmark 和新的 owner 决策，仅适用于后续合同版本。","resolution":"该建议已撤回，且被 owner 的 cases 4/16、workers 1/2 新资源合同取代。","role":"product_pm"}
- {"content":"路由修复期间同一 request_id/run_generation 产生重复 terminal bodies。","evidence_that_can_change_conclusion":"仅 incident 审计能纠正 canonical latest-body 身份；不得按正文数量重新计票。","resolution":"按 owner 指示仅采用各角色最新 completed body；旧副本不计为讨论轮次、贡献或投票。","roles":["security_reviewer","synthesizer"]}

## Open Questions
- None.

